  "prefLabel": "Puc 2502.26 Large biodiesel end user",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 2502.26 “Large biodiesel end user” means a person or entity who or which uses biodiesel to produce useful thermal energy using a thermal energy system with a total gross nameplate heating capacity of all units combined of more than 1,000,000 British thermal units (Btu) per hour of heat input.\n\nSource. #12473, eff 2-1-18",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/puc2500.html"
